  "sourceTitle": "From User Sequences to Scaling Laws: A Multi-Stage Architecture for Meta’s Ads Ranking",
  "sourceBodyHash": "800666f62a80727a73e26ef7ca2ff00c7b2795871a4e8da694ddd93ff1107b13",
